## **Summary of Recommendations**
| Issue                     | Recommendation                                                                 |
|---------------------------|-------------------------------------------------------------------------------|
| Hardcoded secrets/data    | Move sensitive data to `.env` (local) or a secrets manager (production).     |
| No secrets management     | Use `dotenv` for local development and a secrets manager for production.     |
| Lack of environment vars  | Inject secrets as environment variables in Docker/Kubernetes/cloud platforms.|

